   "source": "---\n## Cell 8 — Evaluate on AffectNet (EmpathBot 6-class split)\n\nWe evaluate on the AffectNet test images from `master_split.csv` — the same data pipeline  \nused to train EmpathBot's main model. This uses EmpathBot's **6-class** label scheme.\n\nFor this evaluation, Ada-DF's output is remapped: we select only the 6 relevant AffectNet  \nclasses that map to EmpathBot's categories and measure accuracy on those.\n\n**Why evaluate Ada-DF on AffectNet?**  \nBecause EmpathBot will be deployed on live webcam video — closer in distribution to  \nAffectNet than to the lab-controlled RAF-DB images. A model that holds up on AffectNet  \nis more likely to hold up at deployment time."
