   "source": "# ── Decide evaluation approach ────────────────────────────────────────────────\n# Option A: If Ada-DF was trained on 7 RAF-DB classes, we remap its predictions\n#            to 6 EmpathBot classes for comparison.\n# Option B: If a separate Ada-DF checkpoint trained on AffectNet exists, load it here.\n#            For now we use Option A (single checkpoint, RAF-DB trained).\n\n# AffectNet 8 classes → EmpathBot 6 classes mapping:\n# AffectNet label: 0=neutral, 1=happy, 2=sad, 3=surprise, 4=fear, 5=disgust, 6=angry, 7=contempt\n# EmpathBot label: 0=neutral, 1=trust_relief, 2=sadness, 3=fear_anxiety, 4=confusion, 5=distrust\n#\n# The mapping used in notebook 1 (dataset pipeline):\nAFFNET_TO_EMPATHBOT = {0: 0, 1: 1, 2: 2, 3: 2, 4: 3, 5: 5, 6: 5, 7: 5}\n# contempt (7) → distrust (5), disgust (5) → distrust (5)\n# This matches the mapping defined in the dataset pipeline notebook.\n\n# ── Load AffectNet test split from master CSV ────────────────────────────────\nprint(\"Loading AffectNet test split from master_split.csv...\")\ntry:\n    affnet_test_ds = MasterSplitDataset(\n        csv_path=MASTER_CSV, split=\"test\", source=\"affectnet\", transform=val_transform\n    )\n    affnet_test_loader = DataLoader(\n        affnet_test_ds, batch_size=BATCH_SIZE, shuffle=False, num_workers=NUM_WORKERS\n    )\n    print(f\"  Batches: {len(affnet_test_loader)}\")\n    affnet_available = len(affnet_test_ds) > 0\nexcept FileNotFoundError:\n    print(f\"\\u274c master_split.csv not found at {MASTER_CSV}.\")\n    print(\"   Run notebook 1 (dataset pipeline) first to generate it.\")\n    affnet_available = False\n\nif not affnet_available:\n    print(\"\\u26a0\\ufe0f  Skipping AffectNet evaluation — no data found.\")\n    print(\"   Jump to Cell 9 (confusion matrices) using RAF-DB results only.\")"
